  "bank_matrix": "Retain native GGUF F32 bank and official HF/librosa bank unchanged. Compute native/native-bank, native/HF-bank, HF/native-bank and HF/HF-bank for each fixed PCM. Compare own banks, same native bank and same HF bank on exact common mask-valid rows; retain every raw/padded row and mask.",
  "controls": [
    "16000 samples exact zero",
    "32003 samples:0.2sin(2pi440t)+0.1cos(2pi1234t), t=arange(N)/16000 in float64 then castF32; add F32 impulses0.125,-0.125,0.0625 at indices0,16000,32002"
  ],
  "absolute_tolerance": 0.001,
  "mean_absolute_tolerance": 0.0001,
  "tolerance_purpose": "Synthetic same-bank prerequisite and descriptive numerical flags only, not DER/model or release gates. Fixed before controls/target features. Absolute1e-3 is ten times upstream CPU FE dense-reference unit-test tolerance1e-4; mean1e-4. Preserve any control failure and do not execute target WAVs when a prerequisite fails.",
  "limitations": [
    "Previously seen frozen targets; no new heldout validation. Original quality gate/reference/scorer and all frozen outputs remain unchanged.",
    "Whole centered CPU frontend comparison only. Does not establish streaming chunk/frame readiness, final padding, neural model/conversion/cache equivalence or original-NeMo reproduction.",
    "Same-bank substitutions isolate frontend arithmetic; they do not select or replace a release filterbank or model. Small differences alone do not explain DER failure.",
    "Native raw extra terminal row is retained and reported separately; HF mask-valid prefix defines the comparison. No truncation beyond that declared mask.",
    "Raw feature/bank tensors remain local evidence outside Git; committed metadata and source pins allow replay."
  ],
